  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup tomato juice",
    "1 cup water",
    "1 (.25 ounce) package instant yeast",
    "0.25 cup vegetable oil",
    "0.33329999446869 cup honey",
    "0.25 cup chopped fresh parsley",
    "0.25 cup chopped green onions",
    "2 cloves garlic",
    "1 carrot, shredded",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "6 cups bread flour"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xQ5q4O-GSj0ljr-t_pJR8zbaMcY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6736-tomato-bread-i-DDMFS-step-01-487e2415ad614ec08725dd3f55a858e8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6736/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat tomato juice and water in a saucepan over low heat until warm to the touch; pour into a large warmed bowl. Add yeast and honey; stir to dissolve yeast. Allow to rest until yeast is creamy, about 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tCGNTvwFo4zq0h2bKX8cp9ZVc5U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6736-tomato-bread-i-DDMFS-step-02-725f1a829ef049e29c1a624017ae11ec.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6736/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix in oil, parsley, onion, garlic, carrot, and salt. Add 1 cup of the flour, and stir until smooth. Add more flour, until a firm dough is formed. Knead five minutes on a lightly floured surface.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jpD8XrfwY7wRIkyajRoL5BaDcTo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6736-tomato-bread-i-DDMFS-step-03-d200a0c1363a42a8a29bd4f2fca1337c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6736/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place dough in a greased bowl, and turn to coat the surface completely. Allow to rise in a warm place until doubled in size, about 1 hour. Grease two 9x5-inch loaf pans.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/f8AQcr43iZvqX0YLte9kgO-8xqg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6736-tomato-bread-i-DDMFS-step-04-2207a420028247c48774f68c548b8d14.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6736/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Punch down dough and turn out onto a lightly floured surface; divide dough in half. Form two loaves and place in prepared loaf pans. Allow to rise until loaves have doubled in size, another 45 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VpNR2G4t-hSwCBUqcWV6_vkbQa4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6736-tomato-bread-i-DDMFS-step-05-56a63da0021342eca89505abb9fdd052.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6736/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (220 degrees C). Bakes loaves in the preheated oven until golden brown, about 30 minutes. Remove loaves from pans and transfer to a wire rack to cool.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vjM3GjL4mZ3P_GPwf7pRrit-LjE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/6736-tomato-bread-i-DDMFS-step-06-77c47bdec2a3464eb93a0ba319b756d7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6736/step_06.webp"
    }
  ],
